    "title": "调拨单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增调拨单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>路径：点击右下角的【更多】-【调拨】-右下角【调拨】-选择调出和调入的仓库或者门店，然后选择调拨商品，输入调拨数量后点击完成即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/1379f68390dbe713595348f4e8cea644.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/c024b30e30a14a2ee371ef6b2886da17.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/c34ffef729868370f6a8913551fd8013.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改调拨单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>路径：点击进入到调拨单详情界面，然后点击底部的【修改】按钮，即可修改调拨单的商品信息。</p>\n<p>注意：调出和调入仓库不支持修改。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/93f969ac24d1642ffe6222daac1c6034.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">作废和复制调拨单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E8%B0%83%E6%8B%A8%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>路径：点击进入到调拨单详情界面，然后点击右上角的【...】，然后点击底部的【复制本单】和【作废】按钮，即可复制调拨单和作废单据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/47e9479565430343d5b609c9a497a169.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
